# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF, which is unusual for a
# Python package, makes diffs noisy for contributors on other platforms,
# and breaks any byte-for-byte comparison against a schema or fixture
# published elsewhere with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.whl binary
